{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">韓國三星電子第二季度業績，符合市場預期。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">純利71.6萬億韓圜，折合超過3,866億港元，按年增長13倍。經營盈利89.5萬億韓圜，增長18倍。收入171.5萬億韓圜，增長1.3倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T01:20:00.430063+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}